{"id":517,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>根据《山西省教育厅关于组织申报2026年度研究生教育创新计划各类项目的通知》（晋教研函〔2026〕11号）文件精神，我院开展了2026年度山西省研究生创新项目申报工作。本年度仪器与电子学院共计申报项目316项，其中，学术型博士30项（可申报人数47人），专业型博士1项（可申报人数10人），博士研究生申报率达到54.4%，学术型硕士129项（可申报人数150人），专业型硕士156项（可申报人数195人），硕士研究生申报率达到82.6%。</p><p>项目评审经过初评和终评两个环节，评审成绩及排名如下：</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vL8-6bLzUPnRVRo_R-DM8nknzNDL7WFkUmNPM8laMN-8nNC0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyaMYhVM1hRU878o7CsLzvsozLsol-ioz6VM7UPM4NbnlQFn7U4nR7iMzTFLzLZMzLJv2bjo4OeosTP_InE_dN0qIbtpYyPLmGsg4LZMmGZgtA8pU9cc&oid=1395300322&tid=1207&nid=38608&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C07E6CCA48F71779379B597E4D1799EF/DD3D1559/13853\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vL8-6bLzUPnRVRo_R-DM8nknzNDL7WFkUmNPM8laMN-8nNC0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyaMYhVM1hRU878o7CsLzvsozLsol-ioz6VM7UPM4NbnlQFn7U4nR7iMzTFLzLZMzLJv2bjo4OeosTP_InE_dN0qIbtpYyPLmGsg4LZMmGZgtA8pU9cc&oid=1395300322&tid=1207&nid=38608&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vozG6snlrRLm-YM_4LaUzNDU4V2n7QFRU8U8L47DLzvZnmG0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyZLkh2LkybLRvinzU4Ml7ioRM7nz9DLRMRM8lPUzLbMlnFnm62Lm-bL8VFLzMfU4lJv2bjo4OeosTP_InE_dN0qIbtpYyPLmGsg4LZMmGZgtA8pU9cc&oid=1395300322&tid=1207&nid=38608&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E80F09075E435A583DE8603C7E1A395D/F7F2293A/13AC5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vozG6snlrRLm-YM_4LaUzNDU4V2n7QFRU8U8L47DLzvZnmG0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyZLkh2LkybLRvinzU4Ml7ioRM7nz9DLRMRM8lPUzLbMlnFnm62Lm-bL8VFLzMfU4lJv2bjo4OeosTP_InE_dN0qIbtpYyPLmGsg4LZMmGZgtA8pU9cc&oid=1395300322&tid=1207&nid=38608&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=vLm662nRMRnRCYo_zUZLzv4UNl4Lm-FaUllbU49sMN-iUz70gihFp2hmCIa0LYyiokhfUYhVozGPLmTRMmVRU4nVMlrVnR74LRN4MmGbLlrFMl7bolUDoRfFozvaMSbaptveo4Oe_5VbQdXZ_ShXptQ0g47YLRv0L49DLR9Jqd9nx&oid=1395300322&tid=1207&nid=38608&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/358ACE90129C61CC4E5EED130936091E/5A99D680/9705\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 493px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc